<!doctype html><html lang="es"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Continuity Reframe — Splat del primer fotograma</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#172330;color:#f2f4f5;font:16px/1.5 system-ui}header,main,footer{padding:24px 4vw}h1{font-size:30px;margin:0}p{max-width:90ch;color:#c3d0dc}main{padding-top:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:250px 1fr;gap:24px}aside img{width:100%;border:1px solid #708395}canvas{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;display:block;background:#101923;touch-action:none;border:1px solid #708395;cursor:grab}canvas:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd28b;outline-offset:3px}label{display:block;margin-top:18px}input{width:100%;accent-color:#ffd28b}button{padding:12px;background:#30485d;color:white;border:1px solid #708395;border-radius:5px;margin:8px 6px 0 0;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.warning{color:#ffd28b}output{float:right;color:#ffd28b}.bar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;font-size:14px;color:#c3d0dc}.tag{padding:8px 0}footer{font-size:14px;border-top:1px solid #708395}#status{min-height:24px}textarea{width:100%;min-height:76px;background:#101923;color:#f2f4f5;padding:12px;border:1px solid #708395}@media(max-width:700px){main{display:flex;flex-direction:column}aside img{max-width:250px}canvas{height:auto}h1{font-size:25px}}</style>
<header><h1>Elige la cámara. Exporta la intención.</h1><p>El splat orienta la cámara, incluso si se rompe. La guía final se crea manualmente en GPT con el original y un prompt; no hay conexión automática.</p></header><main><aside><strong>Original · 0,00 s</strong><img id="source" alt="Fotograma de referencia local"><p>Gaussianas suministradas localmente; no se estima profundidad en esta interfaz. No es una reconstrucción multivista optimizada.</p><label for="yaw">Giro <output id="yo"></output></label><input id="yaw" type="range" min="-180" max="180" value="0"><label for="pitch">Elevación <output id="po"></output></label><input id="pitch" type="range" min="-90" max="90" value="0"><label for="radius">Distancia relativa <output id="ro"></output></label><input id="radius" type="range" min="0.65" max="2" step=".05" value="1"><label for="zoom">Zoom óptico relativo <output id="zo"></output></label><input id="zoom" type="range" min="0.6" max="2" step=".05" value="1"><button id="top">Cenital 90°</button><button id="left90">Lateral −90°</button><button id="right90">Lateral +90°</button><button id="reset">Vista original</button><button id="near">Giro suave</button><button id="extreme">Explorar 70°</button></aside><section><canvas id="view" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Vista girable del splat. Arrastra o usa las flechas del teclado."></canvas><div class="bar"><span class="tag">Arrastrar: girar · Rueda: distancia · Flechas: orientar</span><span id="status" role="status"></span></div><p class="warning">El fondo oscuro revela zonas sin datos. Las espaldas y los lados ocultos no fueron observados. Los giros grandes muestran deformaciones.</p><p id="camera-summary" class="warning"></p><label for="notes">Actuación y restricciones de escena</label><textarea id="notes" placeholder="Describe el gesto y sus márgenes; no pidas objetos fuera de campo."></textarea><label for="intent">Prompt editable para GPT</label><textarea id="intent" style="min-height:180px"></textarea><p id="agreement" role="status"></p><button id="regenerate">Regenerar prompt</button><label><input id="include-proxy" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"> Incluir captura orientativa en el paquete</label><button id="save">Guardar paquete JSON</button><button id="original-download">Descargar original</button><button id="proxy-download">Descargar captura orientativa</button><button id="prompt-download">Descargar prompt TXT</button><p>En GPT: adjunta el original, pega el prompt y añade la captura solo si ayuda. El JSON documenta la cámara; no reemplaza adjuntar las imágenes.</p></section></main><footer>La licencia del modelo de profundidad depende del generador externo elegido. Escala y focal supuestas; sin métricas reales. Visor estático de un fotograma, no reconstrucción del movimiento. Sin red, instalaciones ni generación de zonas ocultas. Prototipo local separado del selector.</footer>
<script>
function cameraGeometry(yaw,elevation,distance,targetDepth,zoom=1){
 if(![yaw,elevation,distance,targetDepth,zoom].every(Number.isFinite)||Math.abs(yaw)>180||Math.abs(elevation)>90||distance<=0||targetDepth<=0||zoom<=0)throw Error('Invalid camera parameters');
 const a=yaw*Math.PI/180,e=elevation*Math.PI/180,r=targetDepth*distance;
 const clean=x=>Math.abs(x)<1e-12?0:x;
 const target=[0,0,targetDepth],position=[Math.sin(a)*Math.cos(e)*r,-Math.sin(e)*r,targetDepth-Math.cos(a)*Math.cos(e)*r].map(clean);
 const forward=[-Math.sin(a)*Math.cos(e),Math.sin(e),Math.cos(a)*Math.cos(e)].map(clean);
 const right=[Math.cos(a),0,Math.sin(a)].map(clean);
 const down=[forward[1]*right[2]-forward[2]*right[1],forward[2]*right[0]-forward[0]*right[2],forward[0]*right[1]-forward[1]*right[0]].map(clean);
 const row=v=>[...v,-v.reduce((s,x,i)=>s+x*position[i],0)];
 return {yaw_degrees:yaw,elevation_degrees:elevation,relative_distance:distance,zoom_factor:zoom,position,target,forward,right,down,world_to_camera:[row(right),row(down),row(forward),[0,0,0,1]],projection:{type:'perspective',aspect_ratio:'16:9',reference_width:640,reference_height:360,fx:576*zoom,fy:576*zoom,cx:320,cy:180,horizontal_fov_degrees:2*Math.atan(320/(576*zoom))*180/Math.PI,vertical_fov_degrees:2*Math.atan(180/(576*zoom))*180/Math.PI},is_exact_overhead_in_assumed_axes:elevation===90,axes:'x = source-image right; y = source-image down; z = away from source camera. Assumed vertical, not gravity-calibrated. Side is NOT performer anatomical left/right.',units:'arbitrary proxy units, not meters',pivot:'estimated central depth; not a measured anatomical target'};
}
function cinematicPrompt(c,notes=''){
 let shot=c.is_exact_overhead_in_assumed_axes?'TRUE OVERHEAD / TOP-DOWN: place the camera directly above the target and point the optical axis vertically downward. Do not substitute a high oblique angle or rotate the original flat image.':Math.abs(c.yaw_degrees)===90&&c.elevation_degrees===0?'LATERAL / PROFILE CAMERA at the target height. Change the viewpoint of the scene, not just the actor\'s head or body.':c.yaw_degrees===0&&c.elevation_degrees===0?'FRONTAL CAMERA on the original viewing axis.':'OBLIQUE CAMERA with the requested azimuth and elevation.';
 return 'Create ONE cinematic image guide from the attached ORIGINAL frame. This is manual image creation, not a call to a video model.\n\n'+shot+'\nCamera intention: azimuth '+c.yaw_degrees+' degrees; elevation '+c.elevation_degrees+' degrees; relative orbit distance '+c.relative_distance+'; horizontal field of view '+c.projection.horizontal_fov_degrees.toFixed(2)+' degrees; aspect ratio 16:9. Coordinates refer to source-image axes, not anatomical left/right. Positive azimuth moves the camera toward source-image right; positive elevation moves it above the target. At exactly 90 degrees elevation, azimuth controls in-plane orientation rather than the camera position.\n\nUse the original frame as the authority for identity, initial pose, clothing and known object relationships. Move the CAMERA; do not turn the performer to imitate a new view. Change background perspective, occlusions and vanishing lines coherently. Decide which objects are visible from the chosen camera BEFORE composing: do not move objects into view or request off-screen objects. Preserve the initial pose and allow room for the intended gesture.\n\nAn OPTIONAL proxy screenshot is only an orientation/framing aid. It is NOT an appearance reference: do not reproduce splat holes, stretched texture, missing limbs or depth artifacts. Hidden surfaces are inferred and unverified; do not present them as observed truth. Camera scale, vertical and focal length are assumptions, so prioritize the described cinematic intent over literal physical measurements.\n\n'+(notes.trim()?'Additional scene/gesture constraints: '+notes.trim()+'\n\n':'')+'Before using the guide for video, a human must compare initial posture, identity, object positions, background perspective, visibility and gesture margins against the source. No continuity approval is implied.';
}
if(typeof module!=='undefined')module.exports={cameraGeometry,cinematicPrompt};

let promptManual=false,lastPrompt="";
const DATA=__CAMERA_DATA__, $=id=>document.getElementById(id);$('source').src='data:image/jpeg;base64,'+DATA.source;
const raw=Uint8Array.from(atob(DATA.buffer),c=>c.charCodeAt(0));const points=new Float32Array(raw.buffer);const canvas=$('view'),gl=canvas.getContext('webgl',{preserveDrawingBuffer:true,antialias:false});
if(!gl){$('status').textContent='WebGL no disponible en este navegador.';throw Error('WebGL unavailable')}
function shader(type,src){let s=gl.createShader(type);gl.shaderSource(s,src);gl.compileShader(s);if(!gl.getShaderParameter(s,gl.COMPILE_STATUS))throw Error(gl.getShaderInfoLog(s));return s}
const vs=shader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER,`attribute vec3 pos;attribute vec3 col;attribute float size;attribute float opacity;varying vec3 color;varying float alpha;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(pos,1.);gl_PointSize=size;color=col;alpha=opacity;}`),fs=shader(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER,`precision mediump float;varying vec3 color;varying float alpha;void main(){vec2 p=(gl_PointCoord-.5)*6.;float q=dot(p,p);if(q>9.)discard;gl_FragColor=vec4(color,alpha*exp(-.5*q));}`),program=gl.createProgram();gl.attachShader(program,vs);gl.attachShader(program,fs);gl.linkProgram(program);if(!gl.getProgramParameter(program,gl.LINK_STATUS))throw Error(gl.getProgramInfoLog(program));gl.useProgram(program);const buffer=gl.createBuffer();gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER,buffer);for(const [name,n,offset] of [['pos',3,0],['col',3,12],['size',1,24],['opacity',1,28]]){const loc=gl.getAttribLocation(program,name);gl.enableVertexAttribArray(loc);gl.vertexAttribPointer(loc,n,gl.FLOAT,false,32,offset)}gl.enable(gl.BLEND);gl.blendFunc(gl.SRC_ALPHA,gl.ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA);gl.disable(gl.DEPTH_TEST);
const norm=a=>{const n=Math.hypot(...a);return a.map(v=>v/n)},cross=(a,b)=>[a[1]*b[2]-a[2]*b[1],a[2]*b[0]-a[0]*b[2],a[0]*b[1]-a[1]*b[0]],dot=(a,b)=>a[0]*b[0]+a[1]*b[1]+a[2]*b[2];let lastMs=0;
function render(){const start=performance.now(),w=Math.round(canvas.clientWidth),h=Math.round(canvas.clientHeight);canvas.width=w;canvas.height=h;gl.viewport(0,0,w,h);gl.clearColor(.063,.098,.137,1);gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);const yaw=+$('yaw').value,pitch=+$('pitch').value,relative=+$('radius').value,c=cameraGeometry(yaw,pitch,relative,DATA.target_depth,+$('zoom').value),cam=c.position,forward=c.forward,right=c.right,down=c.down,f=w/640*c.projection.fx,visible=[];
for(let i=0;i<DATA.count;i++){let j=i*8,d=[points[j]-cam[0],points[j+1]-cam[1],points[j+2]-cam[2]],z=dot(d,forward);if(z<=.05)continue;let x=dot(d,right)*f/z,y=dot(d,down)*f/z;if(Math.abs(x)>w*.65||Math.abs(y)>h*.65)continue;visible.push({i,z,x,y})}visible.sort((a,b)=>b.z-a.z);const v=new Float32Array(visible.length*8);visible.forEach((p,k)=>{let i=p.i*8,j=k*8;v[j]=2*p.x/w;v[j+1]=-2*p.y/h;v[j+2]=0;v[j+3]=points[i+3];v[j+4]=points[i+4];v[j+5]=points[i+5];v[j+6]=Math.min(100,Math.max(1,6*points[i+6]*f/p.z));v[j+7]=points[i+7]});gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER,v,gl.DYNAMIC_DRAW);gl.drawArrays(gl.POINTS,0,visible.length);$('yo').textContent=yaw+'°';$('po').textContent=pitch+'°';$('ro').textContent=relative+'×';lastMs=performance.now()-start;$('status').textContent=visible.length.toLocaleString('es')+' gaussianas visibles';updateIntent(c);window.viewerState={yaw,pitch,relative,visible:visible.length,render_ms:lastMs,webgl_error:gl.getError()};}
for(const id of ['yaw','pitch','radius','zoom'])$(id).addEventListener('input',render);function pose(y,p,r=1){$('yaw').value=y;$('pitch').value=p;$('radius').value=r;render()}$('reset').onclick=()=>pose(0,0);$('near').onclick=()=>pose(15,8);$('extreme').onclick=()=>pose(70,10,1.3);let drag=null;canvas.onpointerdown=e=>{drag=[e.clientX,e.clientY,+$('yaw').value,+$('pitch').value];canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)};canvas.onpointermove=e=>{if(!drag)return;pose(Math.max(-180,Math.min(180,drag[2]+(e.clientX-drag[0])*.2)),Math.max(-90,Math.min(90,drag[3]-(e.clientY-drag[1])*.2)),+$('radius').value)};canvas.onpointerup=canvas.onpointercancel=()=>drag=null;canvas.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{e.preventDefault();$('radius').value=Math.max(.65,Math.min(2,+$('radius').value+Math.sign(e.deltaY)*.05));render()},{passive:false});canvas.onkeydown=e=>{let y=+$('yaw').value,p=+$('pitch').value;if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')y-=2;else if(e.key==='ArrowRight')y+=2;else if(e.key==='ArrowUp')p+=2;else if(e.key==='ArrowDown')p-=2;else return;e.preventDefault();pose(y,p,+$('radius').value)};window.addEventListener('resize',render);function updateIntent(c){const proposed=cinematicPrompt(c,$('notes').value);if(!promptManual){$('intent').value=proposed;lastPrompt=proposed;}$('zo').textContent=c.zoom_factor+'×';$('camera-summary').textContent=c.is_exact_overhead_in_assumed_axes?'Cenital geométrico: cámara encima del pivote, mirada vertical. Vertical del escenario supuesta, no calibrada.':'Ángulo oblicuo/frontal: no es cenital. Lados referidos a la imagen original.';$('agreement').textContent=$('intent').value===proposed?'Prompt y controles coinciden.':'Tu texto se conserva; no coincide literalmente con los controles actuales.';}
function getPackage(){const c=cameraGeometry(+$('yaw').value,+$('pitch').value,+$('radius').value,DATA.target_depth,+$('zoom').value);return {schema:'continuity-reframe.camera-intent.v1',camera:c,prompt:$('intent').value,prompt_source:promptManual?'manual':'generated',prompt_matches_current_controls:$('intent').value===cinematicPrompt(c,$('notes').value),notes:$('notes').value,source:{time_seconds:0,role:'identity_pose_objects_authority',filename:'original-frame.jpg',data_url:$('source').src},proxy:$('include-proxy').checked?{role:'orientation_only_not_appearance_or_geometry_truth',filename:'proxy-orientation.png',data_url:canvas.toDataURL('image/png')}:null,manual_handoff:['Download original-frame.jpg and attach it in GPT.','Paste the prompt. Optionally attach the proxy screenshot as orientation only.','Review the generated image before using it as H3 guide.'],reviewed:false,guide_reviewed:false,automatically_sent:false};}
function saveBlob(blob,name){const u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),5000)}
function saveDataURL(url,name){const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click()}
$('save').onclick=()=>saveBlob(new Blob([JSON.stringify(getPackage(),null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),'camera-intent-'+Date.now()+'.json');
$('original-download').onclick=()=>saveDataURL($('source').src,'original-frame-'+Date.now()+'.jpg');$('proxy-download').onclick=()=>saveDataURL(canvas.toDataURL('image/png'),'proxy-orientation-'+Date.now()+'.png');$('prompt-download').onclick=()=>saveBlob(new Blob([$('intent').value],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'}),'camera-prompt-'+Date.now()+'.txt');
$('top').onclick=()=>pose(0,90,+$('radius').value);$('left90').onclick=()=>pose(-90,0,+$('radius').value);$('right90').onclick=()=>pose(90,0,+$('radius').value);$('notes').oninput=()=>render();$('intent').oninput=()=>{promptManual=true;updateIntent(cameraGeometry(+$('yaw').value,+$('pitch').value,+$('radius').value,DATA.target_depth,+$('zoom').value))};$('regenerate').onclick=()=>{if(promptManual&&!confirm('¿Reemplazar tu prompt editado por el de los controles actuales?'))return;promptManual=false;render()};

render();
</script></html>
